{
    "word": "syndic",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "cd296a10-a910-3623-8fa5-c13f4c6cdfe7",
                "word": "syndic",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "a20a16e5-164c-490a-a6d2-ce9d1385e117",
                        "entry_id": "cd296a10-a910-3623-8fa5-c13f4c6cdfe7",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "syndics"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5cbed2f7-83ac-3640-80f4-b0665dc5ed05",
                        "entry_id": "cd296a10-a910-3623-8fa5-c13f4c6cdfe7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A government official having different duties depending on the country; also, a magistrate, especially one of the Chief Magistrates of Geneva, Switzerland."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7c75c987-d00a-44a3-9b44-e215179d263b",
                                "sense_id": "5cbed2f7-83ac-3640-80f4-b0665dc5ed05",
                                "text": "The Bailiffes and Syndicks of Merindoll appeare the ſecond time."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "689ce58a-fbf7-4f04-a56d-fae0be3e0d9d",
                                "sense_id": "5cbed2f7-83ac-3640-80f4-b0665dc5ed05",
                                "text": "[T]he two Syndicks and the reſt of the Magiſtrates of that City began to pry more narrowly into their ſtay, and more neerely into their actions; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eb190bf2-44fe-4190-95b2-1d0cfa37cf07",
                                "sense_id": "5cbed2f7-83ac-3640-80f4-b0665dc5ed05",
                                "text": "This City is govern'd by a Syndick and Twenty Five Senators, who meet every Day to conſult about the Affairs of the Commonwealth, and to decide all Cauſes, whether Criminal or Civil."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2506e728-66ab-4c6a-ad8c-69b71cfe658f",
                                "sense_id": "5cbed2f7-83ac-3640-80f4-b0665dc5ed05",
                                "text": "A syndic shall be appointed for every canal not being administered by a corporation or other public body on behalf of any part of the community."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cfef8c89-c685-4b01-b36d-50bbbf402d40",
                                "sense_id": "5cbed2f7-83ac-3640-80f4-b0665dc5ed05",
                                "text": "To-morrow, after the midday prayer, mount an ass and make for the Habbānīyah quarter and there inquire for the house of the syndic Barakah, known as Abū Shāmah."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "13f3a04b-c786-4d22-a86b-88aa665d7d36",
                                "sense_id": "5cbed2f7-83ac-3640-80f4-b0665dc5ed05",
                                "text": "In 1760 one Intendant went so far as to dissolve the militia altogether and appointed syndics to carry on the local government."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "20cfb435-c919-3d65-8653-638b0dfbdb41",
                        "entry_id": "cd296a10-a910-3623-8fa5-c13f4c6cdfe7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An agent of a corporation, or of any body of people engaged in a business enterprise; specifically, in the University of Cambridge, a member of the senate appointed to carry out specific duties."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "British"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "34878010-512e-497d-b4ab-9b01f2187e68",
                                "sense_id": "20cfb435-c919-3d65-8653-638b0dfbdb41",
                                "text": "In France, syndics are appointed by the creditors of a bankrupt to manage the property."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c03e2bb0-2b49-43e4-9ce4-0f296e4243a3",
                                "sense_id": "20cfb435-c919-3d65-8653-638b0dfbdb41",
                                "text": "The University of Cambridge has syndics who are chosen from the senate to transact special business, such as the regulation of fees and the framing of laws."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4fc8b2e4-b843-4658-a088-93c928209f70",
                                "sense_id": "20cfb435-c919-3d65-8653-638b0dfbdb41",
                                "text": "The duties and powers of a provisional syndic are distinctly set out in section 1793 of the Revised Statutes. It says that \"the duties of the provisional syndic shall consist in keeping, as a deposit, all the goods and other effects of the insolvent debtor; […]\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4b16bb35-94b5-481c-8b33-b4a1e32153c9",
                                "sense_id": "20cfb435-c919-3d65-8653-638b0dfbdb41",
                                "text": "After such cession and acceptance, property of debtor mentioned in schedule shall be vested in creditors; and syndic shall take possession of same and administer and sell according to law."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a5cfe29d-b51e-446c-bbb0-e5e28aa017f9",
                                "sense_id": "20cfb435-c919-3d65-8653-638b0dfbdb41",
                                "text": "A judgment homologating the final account of the syndic of an insolvent estate, which becomes final, is res judicata to all parties who participated in the cession or in concurso."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a519aaec-8655-3b79-9e07-238be6f84e35",
                        "entry_id": "cd296a10-a910-3623-8fa5-c13f4c6cdfe7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A layperson who is given official responsibility for the finances, care, and civil administration of the nonreligious details of a convent or religious community."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0cf994d2-40f0-428e-96d7-37c382e5f245",
                                "sense_id": "a519aaec-8655-3b79-9e07-238be6f84e35",
                                "text": "The larger powers with which the syndic was invested by Martin IV and by his successors, Martin V (\"Constitutiones Martinianae\") in Wadding, \"Annales\", X, 301) and Paul IV (\"Ex Clementi\", 1 July, 1555), gave rise to the appellation syndicus Martinianus in contradistinction to syndicus communis."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fce68dca-751d-464f-a862-9cca499e7176",
                        "source_entry_id": "cd296a10-a910-3623-8fa5-c13f4c6cdfe7",
                        "source_sense_description": "government official having different duties depending on the country",
                        "target_lang_word": "syndic",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "syndic",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "53848435-4a90-3f9d-9946-c6c08c13ceca",
                                        "entry_id": "d676d237-2b3e-3b2e-a9c2-ad8808e1d3e3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne qui est élue ou désignée pour gérer les affaires d’une collectivité."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e26cd6dd-dfb5-4dcf-b8ad-adc984878944",
                                                "sense_id": "53848435-4a90-3f9d-9946-c6c08c13ceca",
                                                "text": "Voilà du moins ce que me dit le guide que m'envoya le syndic, car à Chamouny les guides sont soumis à un syndicat qui règle leurs tours de service."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b436d78a-6c85-498d-95c6-52ab4eeb3fbf",
                                                "sense_id": "53848435-4a90-3f9d-9946-c6c08c13ceca",
                                                "text": "Pourtant, à votre place, j’aurais un peu moins parlé des péchés du duc de Savoie, et un peu plus de ses intelligences présumées avec le syndic de la garde, chef de toute les forces de la ville."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ce684fd-50b3-4cbf-a3b6-c3c483ec7f5a",
                                                "sense_id": "53848435-4a90-3f9d-9946-c6c08c13ceca",
                                                "text": "Une insulte faite au baylon (syndic) est punie d'une amende de dix écus, et même de la prison, à la diligence du viguier ; le délinquant ne sortait de prison que sur l'intervention du syndic."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cf3bdd58-a260-33dd-a2b3-6b30fe946532",
                                        "entry_id": "d676d237-2b3e-3b2e-a9c2-ad8808e1d3e3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne qui est élue ou désignée pour gérer les affaires d’une collectivité.",
                                            "Chef de l’exécutif d’une commune dans les cantons suisses de Fribourg et de Vaud ^([1]), ainsi qu’en Val d’Aoste."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d944e282-4273-3315-b1c8-44ec96d26719",
                                        "entry_id": "d676d237-2b3e-3b2e-a9c2-ad8808e1d3e3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne qui est élue ou désignée pour gérer les affaires d’une collectivité.",
                                            "Personne qui représente un syndicat de copropriété dans la gestion de leurs indivisions."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7378032f-91f7-4f83-b484-f453a41eebda",
                                                "sense_id": "d944e282-4273-3315-b1c8-44ec96d26719",
                                                "text": "Sans compter les syndics qui facturent abusivement des « pré-états datés » en sus (environ 7 % des contrats). Ce tarif imposé devait normalement être limité par un décret de la loi ALUR mais on l'attend toujours, trois ans après."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c057c21a-d34e-4b48-9ee1-a0a9e84455d9",
                                                "sense_id": "d944e282-4273-3315-b1c8-44ec96d26719",
                                                "text": "Depuis le 5 novembre, Marseille tente désespérément de rattraper les années perdues. Les syndics sont submergés d'appels d'habitants inquiets. La municipalité multiplie les expertises en urgence des immeubles signalés. Deux semaines après la catastrophe, plus de 1000 Marseillais avaient été évacués."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd5ddb46-a137-4c7c-927e-4e4f7f4c0e82",
                                                "sense_id": "d944e282-4273-3315-b1c8-44ec96d26719",
                                                "text": "Bien que la loi sur la copropriété n'ait pas prévu d'inscrire à l'ordre du jour une question relative au quitus donné aux syndics, la plupart d'entre eux prévoient une résolution en ce sens."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fec90c89-c2cd-3c10-bed2-af80c52940d0",
                                        "entry_id": "d676d237-2b3e-3b2e-a9c2-ad8808e1d3e3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne au sein d'un ordre professionnel responsable de la discipline professionnelle et l'investigation de possibles inconduites de la part de ses membres."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
